<https://w3id.org/dcat-ap-uk/codelist/geodetic-technique/slr> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:definition "Distances to satellites measured by laser."@en ;
    skos:inScheme ukcl:geodetic-technique ;
    skos:notation "slr" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Satellite laser ranging (SLR)"@en ;
    skos:topConceptOf ukcl:geodetic-technique .

<https://w3id.org/dcat-ap-uk/codelist/geodetic-technique/vlbi> a skos:Concept ;
